            <title>[IGNITE-8938] file-decompressor thread termination should be handled with Failure handler</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8938</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;file-decompressor thread termination should be handled with Failure Handler (IEP-14).&lt;br/&gt;
It doesn&apos;t work right now. Also exception handling in &lt;tt&gt;body()&lt;/tt&gt; method should be revised.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
