                            <comment id="16533886" author="agura" created="Thu, 5 Jul 2018 16:44:33 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Added failure handling for &lt;tt&gt;file-decompressor&lt;/tt&gt; thread. See &lt;tt&gt;FileWriteAheadLogManager&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;FsyncModeFileWriteAheadLogManager&lt;/tt&gt; classes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Also the following changes are made:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Names of threads in &lt;tt&gt;WorkersControlMXBean&lt;/tt&gt; are sorted now.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Fixed issue with two instances of &lt;tt&gt;file-decompressor&lt;/tt&gt; thread.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Fixed failure handling in &lt;tt&gt;file-archiver&lt;/tt&gt; thread.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
